{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は横浜にて握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中会いに来てくださった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございましたo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中の影響もあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「俺、歴史上の人物だと誰タイプ？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とものすごい人数に聞かれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員家康にはしていないので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご安心ください乁( ˙ω˙ 乁)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チラホラ家康っぽい人もいたけどね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熊沢蕃山とか森蘭丸とか山崎闇斎とか池田光政とか平重盛とか源頼政とか明智光秀とか羽柴秀吉とか楠木正成とかいろいろ言ったな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザックリ源氏とか平氏とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平安貴族っぽいとかの方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらっしゃいましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それもご愛嬌ということでm(__)m笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽私服▽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな人が褒めてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤした(。-∀-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/06/08/1674273/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス:Heather"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート:dazzlin"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベルト:お母さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴:去年の冬に買ったため覚えてない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部はノギルームに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演させていただいたときの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルームウェアを着ました！ボーダー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/06/08/1674273/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルームウェア:ジェラートピケ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は、当日にリクエストが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多かったので、久しぶりに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子にしたよーo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈とお揃いだったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真もバッチリ撮りました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとでモバメに送りま～す♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、いつもとメイクが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違ったのですが気付いた方いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもアイラインを少し長く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引いているのを、やめてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"所謂ナチュラルメイクに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつ移行したくて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元々のネコ目がわかりやすいかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽくなったねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われる回数も、近頃は特に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多くなったような気がします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/06/08/1674273/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も会場に来ていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんのわんちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに大人気！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかペット飼いたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬派か猫派かと聞かれたら犬派ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際のところどっちも好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/06/08/1674273/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と未央奈と日奈子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2015/06/08/1674273/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮れなかった琴子も含めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生からも舞台『じょしらく』には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この4名が参加させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩たちに比べると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルにさえ一回しか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出ていないので、演技経験など諸々"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未熟な部分が多いけれど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々のお稽古で奮闘しております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とは同じチーム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐに選抜に入った未央奈とは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にお仕事をする機会が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の二期生と比べると少ない分、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"より嬉しい気持ちが強いです(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台の本番まであともう少し。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日学校に行ってから稽古に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加しているので、時間が全然なくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えることも山程あって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焦ったりもするけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも髪の量も長さもある私にとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何よりも不安なのはカツラです...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンフレットの撮影の時は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭が重いことに慣れなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し気持ち悪くなりました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫かな...m(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ始まる前からそんなことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配しすぎても仕方がないので(笑)、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何はともあれ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調管理もしっかりとして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい舞台にしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは満員電車に揺られつつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校行ってきまーす((o(｡>ω<｡)o))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れな"}],"source":"archive"}